@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
title Proposed — Version, trash, restore and physical reclaim flow
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

start
:Explicit reviewed replace / retire / delete intent;
:Preserve old protected publication / actual material identity;
if (Logical lifecycle operation permitted?) then (yes)
 :Record exact source-defined lifecycle / association change;
 if (Restore requested?) then (yes)
  :Recheck current authority, bytes, keys, references and policy;
  :Restore only actual usable permitted state;
 else (no)
  if (Reclamation eligible and no active/provisional protection?) then (yes)
   :Exclusive deletion claim compatible with reference admission;
   :Observe actual storage deletion;
   :Reconcile actual reclaimed capacity; retain unknown if needed;
  else (no)
   :Retain protected bytes / attributable pending state;
  endif
 endif
else (no)
 :Safe refusal; no silent purge;
endif
stop

@enduml
